WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.877
I go inside--

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.463
What is it?

00:00:09.218 --> 00:00:11.887
Oh, can't I get
one fucking day off?

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.228
Shit.

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:20.729
Listen to me, you ass.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:23.232
I just spent
the last 20 days

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:24.316
running around,

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:26.944
saving the world
from apocalypses,

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.489
only to keep trying
to save the world.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.324
Now I am stuck

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:35.244
in this pubescent body,
my hormones are raging,

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:37.371
and all I wanna do

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:40.123
is go out and buy
a 1970s Corvette Stingray.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.542
Take it easy on him, Five.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:44.044
Lila, this is between me
and myself,

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:45.379
so stay out of it.

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:47.005
Then why are you doing this?

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:48.215
Because he is an idiot.

00:00:48.298 --> 00:00:49.591
Who the hell are you?

00:00:50.259 --> 00:00:51.885
Hi, I'm his loving brother.

00:00:51.969 --> 00:00:54.096
Yeah, come on, Five.
We gotta figure this out.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.557
OK. How about
we take a step back?

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.392
Look at
the big picture here.

00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:00.477
I just spent
the past 20 straight days

00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:02.354
saving the world, twice.

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:05.357
Can I get five minutes
to relax

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.317
before figuring
all the new kinks out?

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:08.694
Please and thank you.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:11.280
Oh, well, since you asked
so nicely, sister mine,

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:12.447
our little paradox

00:01:12.531 --> 00:01:14.116
brought forth
a freaking Kugelblitz.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:16.577
I don't trust him.

00:01:18.245 --> 00:01:19.329
But he's you.

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:21.915
Exactly.

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:23.500
You think
I wanna shoot a kid?

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:25.544
And go home with that
on my conscience?

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.506
Well, I wouldn't worry
about that.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:31.592
You won't be going home.

00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:33.886
What exactly
have we accomplished?

00:01:39.808 --> 00:01:43.312
Well, we made some friends
along the way.

00:01:43.395 --> 00:01:44.354
Incorrect!

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:46.023
You know what we've done?

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:49.776
Nothing. We made things
worse every single time.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.196
Any closer
and I'll melt your brain.

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:54.907
In the end, I had to project
my consciousness forward

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:57.159
into a suspended quantum
state version of myself

00:01:57.242 --> 00:01:59.661
that exists across every
possible instance of time.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:01.288
That makes no sense.

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:02.748
Well, it would
if you were smarter.

00:02:03.415 --> 00:02:06.668
-Hey. Can you go any faster?
-Ask me again

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.587
and I'll burn you
with the cigarette lighter.

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:12.758
Wouldn't your son be happier
playing with kids his age?

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:15.344
Assuming it's OK
with your two dads.

00:02:19.932 --> 00:02:22.392
I would rather chew off
my own foot.

00:02:23.894 --> 00:02:25.646
Do you like jazz, Five?

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:27.314
I'd rather lick
a cheese grater.

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:29.024
I'm the daddy here!

00:02:29.107 --> 00:02:31.443
Hey, Chatty Cathys,
quit the chit-chat, alright?

00:02:31.527 --> 00:02:32.653
I'm calling
a family meeting here.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:34.863
Lose the crazy lady
and come with me.

00:02:34.947 --> 00:02:36.698
We have important business.

00:02:36.782 --> 00:02:38.158
Newsflash, geniuses.

00:02:38.242 --> 00:02:39.743
It's not about us.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.578
It was a simple task!

00:02:41.662 --> 00:02:43.205
All we had to do
was be here!

00:02:43.288 --> 00:02:45.832
Didn't have to fight
a giant sea monster, no.

00:02:45.916 --> 00:02:48.460
An army of mutants? Nein!

00:02:48.544 --> 00:02:49.461
I can't believe this.

00:02:49.545 --> 00:02:52.089
It was handed to us
on a silver platter.

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.924
Could you just moan
a little softer?

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:56.093
My head is killing me.

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:57.511
Listen to me,
you useless puke-bag.

00:02:57.594 --> 00:02:59.972
We just blew our chance
to save the world!

00:03:00.055 --> 00:03:01.181
I'm sorry, OK? I'm sorry.

00:03:01.265 --> 00:03:02.683
I just needed somebody
to come with me

00:03:02.766 --> 00:03:04.101
for emotional support.

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.478
Oh, emotional support?
Like a Schnauzer?

00:03:06.562 --> 00:03:08.605
Now you listen here,
young man.

00:03:09.314 --> 00:03:11.817
No. You listen
to me, asshole.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.235
I've come a long way
for this,

00:03:13.318 --> 00:03:14.236
through some shit

00:03:14.319 --> 00:03:16.280
your pea-brain
couldn't even comprehend.

00:03:16.363 --> 00:03:18.699
So just give me
the information I need

00:03:18.782 --> 00:03:19.950
and I'll be on my merry way.

00:03:20.993 --> 00:03:23.537
And if you call me
"young man" one more time,

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.039
I'm gonna put your head
through that damn wall.

00:03:26.123 --> 00:03:27.124
Oh, dear.

00:03:27.207 --> 00:03:28.375
Oh, who's Diego?

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:32.546
Imagine Batman,
then aim lower.

00:03:32.629 --> 00:03:35.090
Have a look around.
If you hadn't noticed,

00:03:35.174 --> 00:03:37.843
there's no doomsday,
there's no apocalypse.

00:03:37.926 --> 00:03:38.844
The sun is shining.

00:03:38.927 --> 00:03:41.096
Birds are doing
whatever the hell birds do.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:42.139
That's all that matters.

00:03:42.723 --> 00:03:44.266
We're done messing
with time.

00:03:45.267 --> 00:03:47.227
And I'm officially retired.

00:03:50.022 --> 00:03:52.107
Yeah, and I knew you
wouldn't come if I told you,

00:03:52.191 --> 00:03:53.483
so what was I
supposed to do?

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:54.818
Goddamn right,
I wouldn't, Klaus.

00:03:54.902 --> 00:03:56.069
You know why?

00:03:56.153 --> 00:03:57.529
Because I…

00:03:57.613 --> 00:03:59.281
-am supposed to be retired!
-I know.

00:03:59.364 --> 00:04:01.408
This was supposed to be
a carefree road trip.

00:04:01.491 --> 00:04:03.160
Well, it still can be, babe.

00:04:03.994 --> 00:04:06.246
Ball of Twine? Klaus, turn!
Ball of Twine!

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.873
-Turn!
-What? Five!

00:04:07.956 --> 00:04:09.750
-Don't!
-It is one of the best ones!

00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:11.168
-Come on!
-Five, we're gonna die!

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:13.128
-I don't care!
-Let go!

00:04:13.212 --> 00:04:15.422
-Goddammit.
-Shit!

00:04:17.466 --> 00:04:19.551
It is a giant
trash compactor

00:04:19.635 --> 00:04:22.763
which is winding up
the universe

00:04:22.846 --> 00:04:24.890
and consuming it whole,

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:26.183
so tell me

00:04:26.683 --> 00:04:29.186
how you stop it!

00:04:33.815 --> 00:04:35.859
That's one badass stapler.

00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:39.696
The kid wants coffee. Black.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:40.822
Cute kid.

00:04:42.991 --> 00:04:44.618
Then I should probably
get that ink.

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:45.661
Complete the loop.

00:04:46.453 --> 00:04:47.496
Are you sure?

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:51.124
Oh, I don't think destiny
cares whether I am or not.

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:53.210
Bitch is cruel, ain't she?

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.294
Leave the pot here.

00:04:55.045 --> 00:04:56.046
Thank you.

00:04:56.672 --> 00:04:58.006
Lippy little shit.

